{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おとといは若月の舞台の\n『ヴァンパイア騎士- Revive-』\nゲネプロを観に行ってきたよー！\nらんぜと！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回も観に行かせてもらったけど\n本当に若月が可愛くて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう黒主優姫ちゃん好きです！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"舞台稽古も\nベマーズの撮影とか他にもお仕事が\nいろいろある中で大変だったと思うけど\n頑張れー！！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/07/03/2546381/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂のオフィシャルウェブショップで\n8月生まれメンバーの生誕Tシャツが\n出ました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年はボックスロゴでしたけど\n今回はだまし絵にしました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/07/03/2546381/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"後ろには\n「KANA NAKADA」とか「乃木坂46」とか\n入ってるけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何か羽織れば見えなくなるので\n着て電車にも乗れるよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/07/03/2546381/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"現場で着替えたりしなくても大丈夫＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"締め切りも早めだし\n再販もないから\n去年買ってなくて後悔してた方もいたけど\n今年こそはGetしてください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/07/03/2546381/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"受付期間は\nあさって５日の１２時までです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒に着ましょ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46 OFFICIAL WEB SHOPで受付中です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.githu